[00:21.100]James gets his brush pot.
[00:24.300]“It doesn’t look very nice!”
[00:26.900]“Don’t worry,” Miss Li says. “It’s about to change.”
[00:31.900]“What do you think I should paint?”
[00:34.500]James asks Xiaopu.
[00:37.600]“How about bamboo?
[00:39.800]Bamboo is one of the four noble plants in Chinese culture.”
[00:48.900]“Good idea!”
[00:50.500]James begins to paint.
[00:52.800]“Oh, it’s hard to draw the leaves!”
[00:56.200]James says.
